flowchart LR
  A["`**Http::pool(fn (Pool $pool) => [...])**
  collects the requests`"] --> B["`Guzzle sends them
  **at the same time**
  (curl multi handle)`"]
  B --> C{"`concurrency
  set?`"}
  C -- "default (13.x): all at once" --> D["`Every request in flight
  wait = the **slowest** one`"]
  C -- "concurrency: 2" --> E["`At most 2 in flight,
  the next starts when one ends`"]
  D --> F["`Results array, keyed by
  index or **as('name')**
  in **completion order**`"]
  E --> F
  F --> G["`Each entry is a **Response**
  (check ok / failed)
  or an **exception**
  (timeout, DNS, throw())`"]
